WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.970
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No leasing out The Living

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.009
Room!

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:11.240
SCP-002 is a room constructed from flesh,
hair, bones, and other substances that make

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.749
up the human body.

00:00:12.749 --> 00:00:16.869
It is, in the most literal sense possible,
a Living Room.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:21.349
It has also been responsible for the disappearance
of several members of personnel, and should

00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:27.820
not, under any circumstances, be leased or
rented out to civilians or Foundation staff!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:32.500
This includes listing the place on Craigslist,
posting ads in local newspapers, or renting

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.620
it out on AirBNB for hapless tourists.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:40.310
Even if staying in SCP-002 wouldn't result
in one's untimely death, Dr. Bright doesn't

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.310
even have a real estate license!

